OL,3,GNEWSATV traffic cop sacked over
OL,4,Amotoring offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer who regularly appeared
OL,7,Fon TV confronting law-breaking
OL,8,Fmotorists has been dismissed for gross
OL,9,Fmisconduct after a disciplinary panel
OL,10,Fheard he committed multiple offences
OL,11,Fhimself.
OL,13,FPC Nick Lovatt, who worked for
OL,14,FDerbyshire Police, was followed by
OL,15,Fcameras for the Channel 5 shows Police
OL,16,FInterceptors and Traffic Cops.
OL,18,FHe has been sacked after a tribunal
OL,19,Ffound he had committed more than 20
OL,20,Ftraffic offences by riding motorbikes
OL,21,Fwithout insurance or MOT.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
